### Testing & coverage

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt pytest pytest-cov
bash scripts/ci_coverage_badge.sh -- tests/ -q --cov=skopos
```

**227** pytest cases · line coverage on `skopos/` tracked in [`docs/badges/coverage.svg`](docs/badges/coverage.svg) (regenerate with `bash scripts/ci_coverage_badge.sh`, verified by [CI](.github/workflows/ci.yml)).

